# private_markets

Source: https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs/openapi.yaml; retrieved 2026-09-24T01:21:27.462441+00:00

Full descriptions, inherited security, effective parameters, responses and schemas. No live calls.

## GET /api/private-markets/companies

List Private Markets Companies

Returns Nasdaq Private Markets companies, optionally filtered by sector or name. Sorted alphabetically.

This is a premium endpoint. Contact dev@unusualwhales.com to request access.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
