## GET /api/private-markets/companies/{npm_ticker}

Private Markets Company Profile

Returns a profile for a single private-markets company including the latest pricing tick,
total funding raised across known rounds, and the count of disclosed investors.

This is a premium endpoint. Contact dev@unusualwhales.com to request access.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
